00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:51.960
Trump has brought up this issue of mini strokes,
which is not a claim that's actually made

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:52.960
in the book.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:57.879
Trump introduces the idea of strokes in a
tweet last week where he said, quote, It never

00:00:57.879 --> 00:00:58.879
ends.

00:00:58.879 --> 00:01:02.289
Now they are trying to say that your favorite
