00:01:02.289 --> 00:01:07.320
Center, having suffered a series of mini strokes,
never happened to this candidate.

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:08.540
Fake news.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.720
Perhaps they're referring to another candidate
from another party.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:17.930
Then Trump brings it up again during this
Latrobe, Pennsylvania, Corona rally, which

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.720
I covered last week.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:25.240
Trump spent several minutes on this, again,
telling this totally implausible story that

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:26.520
he said, hey, you know what?

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:32.250
Let's go over to Walter Reed last minute to
get a jump on next year's physical.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.670
